replies.body:
Fair pushback, thanks.

1. Your strategies stay yours, we don't resell them! Do you think we should add that info somewhere in the landing page? The value we add is the compute, backtest engine, and live execution plumbing for you;
2. LLM prompts run on zero-retention API tiers, no training on user data according to their TOS;
3. You're right that most retail indicators don't hold up, the point is finding that out in a weekend instead of six months, then moving to the next one. Regarding the indicators, we're trying to expand the catalog daily; recent additions: trendline breakout, news indicator, fair value gaps, Opening Range Breakouts (ORB)…
